{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 2296434041622181958, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "retries 503 with bounded attempts; no retry on other errors\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"README.md": {"bytes": 96, "mtime": 1792286047.5221384, "sha256": "4b6141730d2c1b7fdbc977c1575d67ebdcde4f155ea0f8014444615df7e2d1cb"}, "weather.py": {"bytes": 941, "mtime": 1792468080.7161057, "sha256": "39c8241e2c5d16cfa95f83e849920f2ae5f2f8726aeb7349e8e5ccad5a9706ac"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp", "-p", "Add retry with backoff (3 attempts) to `WeatherClient.get` when the server returns 503.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/transcripts/without/trig-omp-netclient/8/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/cells/without/trig-omp-netclient/8/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/16.2.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Now verify against a real local HTTP server.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503. It makes at most 3 attempts and waits longer between each one (exponential backoff).\n\n- **What is retried:** only HTTP 503. `urlopen` reports it as an `HTTPError`, which is caught and checked for code 503. Any other HTTP error is raised right away. Timeouts and connection errors (`URLError`) are not retried.\n- **Backoff:** the client waits `backoff \u00d7 2^(attempt\u22121)` seconds before trying again. With the default `backoff=0.5`, that's 0.5s and then 1s.\n- **When all 3 attempts get 503:** the last 503 `HTTPError` is raised to the caller, so callers see the same error type as before.\n- **Settings:** the constructor takes two new keyword arguments, `max_attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`. Existing calls work unchanged.\n\nI tested it against a real local HTTP server:\n- Two 503s, then a 200: returned the data after 3 requests.\n- Three 503s: raised `HTTPError 503` after 3 requests.\n- One 500: raised immediately after 1 request.\n\nI didn't add a permanent test file; the repo has no test suite.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 104758, "requests_cache_write": 108773, "requests_cost_usd": 0.6018526, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1849, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial8", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 74, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:47:48.853160+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 22.062, "t_checker_s": 2.381, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_